  "method": "Union actual same-net polygons and saved fills, subtract every physical drill on its span, clip to native outline. Each positive-area connected polygon is one topology node. Consecutive actual barrel spans connect finite annuli; a span is mandatory only if removing its graph edge disconnects the actual source and load contacts.",
